From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saturn <saturn@localhost>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 13:50:23 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] Saturn: favourites/Pinned list store, spaces in one
 window, sidebar polish

Favourites and the Pinned list are Saturn links saved in Saturn State.json
(not pinned tabs/bookmarks); spaces switch in the same window, optionally with
their own storage partition (cookies); no hover cards, no taskbar profile
badge, X stop icon, lighter URL pill on hover, always-visible divider.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
